        "description": "<p>Lizards use their Dexterity modifier for @Check[skill:climb]{Climb check}s. They gain a +8 species bonus on @Check[skill:balance]{Balance check}s and a +4 species bonus on Hide and @Check[skill:moveSilently]{Move Silently check}s. In wooded or overgrown areas, the species bonus on @Check[skill:hide]{Hide check}s improves to +8.</p>",
